sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Kafka as Kafka / Event Source
    participant Prometheus as Prometheus / Metrics Provider
    participant Operator as KEDA Operator (Controller)
    participant MetricsSvc as KEDA Metrics Server (APIService)
    participant HPA as K8s HPA Controller
    participant Deployment as Target Deployment (Pods)

    Kafka->>Prometheus: Expose consumer group lag metrics
    Note over Operator,MetricsSvc: Control Plane Polling Loop
    Operator->>Prometheus: Poll metrics via ScaledObject triggers (every 15s)
    alt Metric > Activation Threshold (0 to 1)
        Operator->>Deployment: Direct scale from 0 to 1 replica (Activate)
    end
    HPA->>MetricsSvc: Query custom external metric (keda.sh)
    MetricsSvc->>Prometheus: Evaluate PromQL expression
    Prometheus-->>MetricsSvc: Return current metric value
    MetricsSvc-->>HPA: Return calculated metric value
    HPA->>Deployment: Adjust replica count (Scale 1 -> N)
    Deployment->>Kafka: Worker pods drain consumer queue
